@startuml
title Page 2 - Processing and review queue
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
actor "Authorized user" as User
boundary "Review queue UI\n(page 2)" as UI
control "Backend API\nFastAPI (provisional)" as API
control "Processing / job service" as Job
database "Document status /\nrecord store" as Store
boundary "Validation UI\n(page 3)" as Review

note over UI, Store
  AWS application; frontend framework deferred (#78).
  Status metadata: Snowflake provisional; the location of
  unapproved extracted values remains undecided (#78).
end note

== Open queue and search ==
User -> UI: Open review queue (from page 1 or navigation)
UI -> API: Request queue entries (search, status filter)
API -> Store: Query document metadata and review statuses
alt Entries found
  Store --> API: Document names, statuses, feedback, action eligibility
  API --> UI: Queue entries and available actions
  UI --> User: Display rows and actions
else Queue is empty
  Store --> API: No queue entries exist
  API --> UI: Empty queue
  UI --> User: Show empty queue state
else No matching results
  Store --> API: Queue exists; no entries match filters
  API --> UI: No matching results
  UI --> User: Show no matching results
else Store or service error
  Store --> API: Query failed
  API --> UI: Queue request failed
  UI --> User: Show error and allow another request
end

loop User changes search or status filter
  User -> UI: Search filename, material ID or vendor; select status
  note over UI, API
    Filters: All, Processing, Failed, Unsupported,
    Pending, Flagged; Approved is handled below.
    Uploaded and Done are document statuses.
  end note
  UI -> API: Request entries with search and status filter
  API -> Store: Query matching queue metadata
  alt Matches / empty queue / no matches
    Store --> API: Matching rows or distinct empty result
    API --> UI: Rows or empty / no-match response
    UI --> User: Update results and feedback
  else Query fails
    Store --> API: Query error
    API --> UI: Filter request failed
    UI --> User: Show service error
  end
end
opt User selects Approved
  User -> UI: Select Approved status
  UI -> API: Request approved queue entries
  API --> UI: No approved entries in review queue
  UI --> User: Show no matches; direct user to Materials (page 4)
end

== Processing status and details ==
User -> UI: View status of a Processing document / refresh
UI -> API: Request processing details and current status
API -> Job: Get job status and feedback
alt Status available
  Job -> Store: Read latest document and review status
  Store --> Job: Current status and feedback
  Job --> API: Processing details and status
  API --> UI: Status and processing details
  UI --> User: Show progress or result
else Job or store unavailable
  Job --> API: Status request failed
  API --> UI: Processing details unavailable
  UI --> User: Show error and allow refresh
end
opt Job completes asynchronously
  alt Extraction succeeds
    Job -> Store: Set document Done; review Pending or Flagged
    Store --> Job: Status update acknowledged
  else Extraction fails
    Job -> Store: Set document Failed with feedback
    Store --> Job: Status update acknowledged
  end
  note over Job, Store
    Neither outcome approves the record. Approval is a
    separate authorized action on page 3.
  end note
end

== Review a ready document ==
User -> UI: Open review for Pending or Flagged record
UI -> API: Request review handoff (document reference)
alt Authorized and still ready for review
  API --> UI: Review handoff accepted
  UI -> Review: Open page 3 with record reference
  Review --> User: Show validation view
else No permission, stale status or service error
  API --> UI: Handoff rejected or unavailable
  UI --> User: Show feedback; keep queue visible
end

== Retry or replace a failed document ==
User -> UI: Select retry or replacement for Failed document
UI -> API: Request retry / submit replacement PDF
alt Accepted
  API -> Job: Request retry / replacement processing
  alt Job accepted
    Job -> Store: Record updated document / job status
    Store --> Job: Update acknowledged
    Job --> API: Job accepted and current status
    API --> UI: Retry / replacement acknowledged
    UI --> User: Show acknowledgment and current status
  else Job or status update fails
    Job --> API: Request failed
    API --> UI: Retry / replacement failed
    UI --> User: Show failure; do not claim processing started
  end
else Invalid PDF, denied, or backend unavailable
  API --> UI: Request rejected / service error
  UI --> User: Show reason or service error
end

note over UI, Review
  Page 1 upload and page 3 validation contracts (#85, #87)
  are unresolved; references and messages here are conceptual.
  Replacement PDF handling and job refresh mechanism are deferred.
end note
@enduml